msgid "Send HTML"
msgstr "傳送 HTML"

msgid "Whether the mails should be sent as HTML. A module like <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/swiftmailer\">Swiftmailer</a> is needed for this feature. This has only been tested with the Swiftmailer module, other modules might not work out of the box and will not use the provided default template."
msgstr "是否應將郵件作為 HTML 傳送。此功能需要 <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/swiftmailer\">Swiftmailer</a> 之類的模組。只使用了 Swiftmailer 模組進行測試，其他模組可能不會運作良好，並且不會使用提供的預設範本。"

msgid "The possible values this field can contain. Enter one value per line, in the format key|label|emails."
msgstr "此欄位可包含的可能值。每行輸入一個值，格式為 key|label|emails。"

msgid "\"key\" is the message that is added to the body of the message."
msgstr "\"key\" 是新增至訊息主體的訊息。"

msgid "\"label\" is the value displayed in the dropdown menu on the contact form."
msgstr "\"label\" 是在聯絡表單的下拉功能表中顯示的值。"

msgid "\"emails\" are the email addresses to add to the recipients list (each separated by a comma)."
msgstr "\"emails\" 是要新增至收件者清單的電子郵件位址（每個位址之間以逗點區隔）。"

